# Marketplace screenshots are committed release deliverables
# (regenerate with: node marketplace/capture-screenshots.mjs)

# Assembled marketplace package (rebuild with node packaging/build-release.mjs).
# Only the transient unpacked working folders are ignored — the versioned
# release/APIForge-X-v*/ package (zips, Documentation, README, manifest,
# verification report) is committed as the shippable deliverable.
release/*/APIForge-X-Developer/
release/*/APIForge-X-Preview/
